CREDITS
=======

QBlocker4arm exists because of QBlocker, by Stephen Radford:

    https://github.com/steve228uk/QBlocker

Thanks, Stephen. QBlocker is the idea — hold `⌘Q` to quit, rather than quitting
an app because you meant to close its window. That app made the idea obvious,
and it deserved to outlive Intel. Everything here was rewritten from scratch for
Apple Silicon and modern Xcode, but it stands on top of the original.

